63.,2038,12597421,159107,155,112,9349,2651,5335,1450,3495.,3469,"Hops servers for Mondo Chick during minutes 0-15 of every hour (UTC clock), farms Mountain Top Field while staying 40 studs away from her until your bees kill her, then collects the loot for 60s and moves on. It has no Start button of its own: press Start on Vichop / Sprouts / Windy and Mondo takes over by itself in that window, then your mode continues.task.spawn(function()\n\tif not game:IsLoaded() then game.Loaded:Wait() end\n\tif getgenv()._nhjob == game.JobId then return end\n\tlocal ok, e = pcall(function() loadstring(readfile(\"NovaHop/source_premium.lua\"))() end)\n\tif not ok then warn(\"[NovaHop] queued start failed: \" .. tostring(e)) end\nend)\nWalks under Windy to start the fight, then farms the loot in its field (following it to the next field) while your bees fight. Hops away from any Windy above the max level, and right after killing one at the max level.Setup: 1) same room key on every account. 2) Turn Main ON for ONE account and Alt ON for every other account (they can't both be on). 3) Press Start on all of them.MAIN: searches servers itself AND follows the alts: as soon as an alt reports a vic / sprout / Windy Bee it joins that server and does the kill.ALT: only searches. It never kills or loots: it hops servers, reports finds to the main and leaves once the main arrives. It skips Mondo.\nDon't hop is ON: the main never hops on its own, it stays in its server until an alt reports a find, then joins it.Before every hop NovaHop harvests planters that are ready, picks up the drops, replants, then keeps hopping.SOLO: this account works alone (it hops and kills by itself). Turn on Main or Alt to use the room.task.spawn(function() pcall(function() loadstring(readfile(\"NovaHop/guard.lua\"))() end) end)\n[NovaHop] executor is missing request/readfile/writefile/isfile/isfolder/makefolderhttps://www.roblox.com/Thumbs/Asset.ashx?width=420&height=420&assetId=4744658743MAIN: set the room key so it can follow your alts. Without one it works alone.No source_premium.lua: put NovaHop in autoexec or it won't restart after hopshttps://games.roblox.com/v1/games/%d/servers/Public?sortOrder=Asc&limit=100MAIN: Mondo hop is solo, the room is paused until the Mondo window ends.<font color=\"%s\">\xE2\x97\x8F</font> %s  <font color=\"#969aa4\">%s \xC2\xB7 %s</font>\nSet the same room key as your main or nobody hears its reports.Epic, Legendary, Supreme and Gummy sprouts are always farmed.To Make Honey, Collect Pollen From Flower Fields\nDon't hop is ON: this alt stays in this server.if game.PlaceId ~= 1537690962 then return endMountain Top Field is locked (needs 25 bees)Waiting for an alt report (Don't hop is on)this executor has no http request functionhttp://www.roblox.com/asset/?id=4528208186loadstring(readfile(\"NovaHop/boot.lua\"))()http://www.roblox.com/asset/?id=253828517 size=%.1f,%.1f,%.1f color=%s material=%srbxasset://textures/MouseLockedCursor.pnghttps://novahop-relay.lmgmeee.workers.dev[Panda] Library failed to initialize.rate-limited (HTTP 429), slowing downhttps://secure.pandauth.com/pv4/libWaiting for Windy to reach a fieldInspect: no sprout in this serverCheckForNearbyHarvestablePlanters (full text in NovaHop/error.txt) hides  |  drag the title to movesaved to NovaHop/sprout_info.txtWindy reached max level, hoppingPlanters need attention, pausingListening to the shared vic feedRoom key (same on all accounts)https://YOUR-RELAY.workers.devBetter sprout found, switchingWaiting for Windy to respawn (Alt report came in, joining ithttps://discord.gg/7MH9BjKTj8Connection problem, rejoiningWindy never landed, moving onSprout down, collecting dropsNo reports, searching myselfKilled vic, looking for nextKilled vic, waiting for nextPriority 1 is more importantGoing to Mountain Top FieldNovaHop/source_premium.luaDiscord webhook (optional)Mondo Chick defeated (Lvl Vicious Bee defeated (Lvl FilterDescendantsInstancespick at least one planterAlt account (search only